      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PARIS WINDS (4) did not come up in 4 starts this prep in Victoria, but a couple of those efforts were sound without much luck. She makes her local debut off a near 9-week break and is sure to be ready to rumble. Check for any market confidence. GILLY'S BOY (1) won his debut by a neck, and then finished close up to the minor placings in fourth place here nearly 3 weeks ago. He has a superior gate here, and should be fighting out the finish again. WARRIOR SMILE (2) made his local debut here nearly 4 weeks ago, and finished third, less than 2 lengths from the winner. He has trialled up quietly since then, and can go close to taking this out. OXIDIZE (7) found the line with purpose fresh up when finishing runner-up by a length here 12 days ago. Her only win came second up from a spell, and she can add to that record here.",
